🩺 Skin Cancer Detection & Smart Doctor Appointment System

 📌 Overview

A Django-based healthcare platform that combines AI-powered skin cancer detection with an online doctor consultation and appointment booking system.

The system allows users to upload skin lesion images for instant melanoma risk prediction, book appointments with dermatologists, receive digital prescriptions, and manage complete consultation history.

---

 🚀 Problem Solved

Early detection of skin cancer is critical, but manual diagnosis can be slow and inaccessible.

This system solves that by:

* Detecting melanoma using Deep Learning
* Enabling online doctor appointments
* Providing digital prescriptions
* Managing patient medical history
* Improving accessibility to dermatology services

---

 🧠 AI / ML Model Used

* TensorFlow / Keras CNN Model
* Model File: `melanoma_model.h5`

 Classification Output

* BENIGN → Low Risk
* MALIGNANT → High Risk

---

 📊 Dataset Used

Skin lesion image dataset for melanoma classification.

Input Size: `224 x 224`

Classification Type: Binary Image Classification

