 ✨ Features

 👤 Patient Module

* Registration & login
* Upload skin lesion image
* Instant cancer prediction
* View confidence score
* Book doctor appointments
* Online payment simulation
* Download consultation token
* View diagnosis history
* Access prescriptions
* Chat with admin

---

 👨‍⚕️ Doctor Module

* Doctor registration & approval
* View patient bookings
* Access patient history
* Add prescriptions
* Diagnose cases
* Mark consultation complete

---

 🛠️ Admin Module

* Manage doctors & patients
* Monitor all detections
* View feedback
* Chat with users
* Activate / deactivate doctors

---

 🔬 AI Skin Cancer Detection

* Upload image
* Image preprocessing
* CNN prediction
* Confidence score analysis
* Risk classification
* Medical recommendation output

---

 ⚙️ AI Workflow

1. Upload skin image
2. Resize to 224×224
3. Normalize image
4. CNN prediction
5. Risk classification
6. Confidence score generation
7. Diagnosis recommendation display

---

 📈 Results

* High prediction accuracy
* Real-time detection response
* Confidence score reporting
* Automated medical suggestion

